   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función definida, para \\(x\\neq0\\), por \\(f(x)=x\\,e^{1/x}\\). Determina las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Vertical (</b>\\(x=0\\)<b>):</b></p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0^+}xe^{1/x}=0\\cdot\\infty\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{e^{1/x}}{1/x}\\overset{t=1/x}=\\lim_{t\\to+\\infty}\\frac{e^t}t\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{t\\to+\\infty}e^t=+\\infty\\]\\[\\lim_{x\\to0^-}xe^{1/x}=0\\cdot e^{-\\infty}=0\\cdot0=0\\]<p>(Regla de L'Hôpital<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>.) \\(x=0\\) es asíntota vertical (solo por la derecha).</p><p><b>Horizontales:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}xe^{1/x}=\\pm\\infty\\cdot e^0=\\pm\\infty\\). No hay.</p><p><b>Oblicuas </b>\\(y=mx+n\\)<b>:</b></p>\\[m=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{f(x)}x=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}e^{1/x}=1,\\qquad n=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}x\\left(e^{1/x}-1\\right)\\overset{t=1/x}=\\lim_{t\\to0}\\frac{e^t-1}t\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{t\\to0}e^t=1\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,211.5 21.1,210.8 22.1,210.2 23.2,209.6 24.3,208.9 25.4,208.3 26.4,207.6 27.5,207.0 28.6,206.4 29.7,205.7 30.7,205.1 31.8,204.4 32.9,203.8 33.9,203.2 35.0,202.5 36.1,201.9 37.2,201.2 38.2,200.6 39.3,200.0 40.4,199.3 41.5,198.7 42.5,198.1 43.6,197.4 44.7,196.8 45.7,196.1 46.8,195.5 47.9,194.9 49.0,194.2 50.0,193.6 51.1,193.0 52.2,192.3 53.2,191.7 54.3,191.1 55.4,190.4 56.5,189.8 57.5,189.2 58.6,188.5 59.7,187.9 60.8,187.3 61.8,186.6 62.9,186.0 64.0,185.4 65.0,184.8 66.1,184.1 67.2,183.5 68.3,182.9 69.3,182.3 70.4,181.6 71.5,181.0 72.6,180.4 73.6,179.8 74.7,179.1 75.8,178.5 76.8,177.9 77.9,177.3 79.0,176.7 80.1,176.0 81.1,175.4 82.2,174.8 83.3,174.2 84.3,173.6 85.4,173.0 86.5,172.3 87.6,171.7 88.6,171.1 89.7,170.5 90.8,169.9 91.9,169.3 92.9,168.7 94.0,168.1 95.1,167.5 96.1,166.9 97.2,166.3 98.3,165.7 99.4,165.1 100.4,164.5 101.5,163.9 102.6,163.4 103.7,162.8 104.7,162.2 105.8,161.6 106.9,161.0 107.9,160.5 109.0,159.9 110.1,159.3 111.2,158.8 112.2,158.2 113.3,157.7 114.4,157.1 115.5,156.6 116.5,156.0 117.6,155.5 118.7,155.0 119.7,154.5 120.8,154.0 121.9,153.5 123.0,153.0 124.0,152.5 125.1,152.0 126.2,151.5 127.2,151.1 128.3,150.6 129.4,150.2 130.5,149.8 131.5,149.4 132.6,149.0 133.7,148.7 134.8,148.4 135.8,148.0 136.9,147.8 138.0,147.5 139.0,147.3 140.1,147.1 141.2,146.9 142.3,146.8 143.3,146.7 144.4,146.7 145.5,146.7 146.6,146.7 147.6,146.7 148.7,146.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='153.4,-4364.0 154.4,-802.7 155.5,-234.3 156.5,-65.0 157.6,5.1 158.7,40.4 159.7,60.6 160.8,73.3 161.8,81.7 162.9,87.6 163.9,91.8 165.0,94.9 166.0,97.3 167.1,99.0 168.2,100.4 169.2,101.4 170.3,102.1 171.3,102.7 172.4,103.1 173.4,103.4 174.5,103.5 175.5,103.6 176.6,103.6 177.6,103.5 178.7,103.4 179.8,103.3 180.8,103.0 181.9,102.8 182.9,102.5 184.0,102.2 185.0,101.9 186.1,101.5 187.1,101.1 188.2,100.7 189.3,100.3 190.3,99.9 191.4,99.4 192.4,99.0 193.5,98.5 194.5,98.0 195.6,97.6 196.6,97.1 197.7,96.6 198.8,96.1 199.8,95.5 200.9,95.0 201.9,94.5 203.0,94.0 204.0,93.4 205.1,92.9 206.1,92.3 207.2,91.8 208.2,91.2 209.3,90.7 210.4,90.1 211.4,89.6 212.5,89.0 213.5,88.4 214.6,87.8 215.6,87.3 216.7,86.7 217.7,86.1 218.8,85.5 219.9,84.9 220.9,84.4 222.0,83.8 223.0,83.2 224.1,82.6 225.1,82.0 226.2,81.4 227.2,80.8 228.3,80.2 229.4,79.6 230.4,79.0 231.5,78.4 232.5,77.8 233.6,77.2 234.6,76.6 235.7,76.0 236.7,75.4 237.8,74.8 238.8,74.2 239.9,73.6 241.0,72.9 242.0,72.3 243.1,71.7 244.1,71.1 245.2,70.5 246.2,69.9 247.3,69.3 248.3,68.7 249.4,68.0 250.5,67.4 251.5,66.8 252.6,66.2 253.6,65.6 254.7,64.9 255.7,64.3 256.8,63.7 257.8,63.1 258.9,62.5 260.0,61.8 261.0,61.2 262.1,60.6 263.1,60.0 264.2,59.4 265.2,58.7 266.3,58.1 267.3,57.5 268.4,56.9 269.4,56.2 270.5,55.6 271.6,55.0 272.6,54.4 273.7,53.7 274.7,53.1 275.8,52.5 276.8,51.9 277.9,51.2 278.9,50.6 280.0,50.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,210.0 150.0,130.8 280.0,51.7' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='150.0' y1='210.0' x2='150.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 146.7H294.0M150.0 224.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='46.0' y1='143.7' x2='46.0' y2='149.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='43.0' y='160.7' font-size='10'>-4</text><line x1='98.0' y1='143.7' x2='98.0' y2='149.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='95.0' y='160.7' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='202.0' y1='143.7' x2='202.0' y2='149.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='199.0' y='160.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='254.0' y1='143.7' x2='254.0' y2='149.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='251.0' y='160.7' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='147.0' y1='178.3' x2='153.0' y2='178.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='182.3' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='115.0' x2='153.0' y2='115.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='119.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='83.3' x2='153.0' y2='83.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='87.3' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='147.0' y1='51.7' x2='153.0' y2='51.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='55.7' font-size='10'>6</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Asíntota vertical \\(x=0\\) (por la derecha) y asíntota oblicua \\(y=x+1\\) (en \\(+\\infty\\) y en \\(-\\infty\\))</div></div>"
    }
   ],
