  {
   "id": "matematicas-2008-reserva-3-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función dada por \\(f(x)=e^{-2x}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Justifica que la recta de ecuación \\(y=-2ex\\) es la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=-\\frac12\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\), el eje de ordenadas y la recta tangente del apartado anterior."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f\\left(-\\tfrac12\\right)=e^1=e,\\qquad f'(x)=-2e^{-2x}\\Rightarrow f'\\left(-\\tfrac12\\right)=-2e\\]\\[y-e=-2e\\left(x+\\tfrac12\\right)\\iff y=-2ex-e+e=-2ex\\]<div class='res'>La tangente en \\(x=-\\frac12\\) es \\(y=-2ex\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es convexa (\\(f''=4e^{-2x}\\gt0\\)): queda por encima de su tangente. El recinto va de \\(x=-\\frac12\\) al eje \\(OY\\) (\\(x=0\\)):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='126.4,64.6 127.8,66.9 129.3,69.2 130.8,71.4 132.3,73.6 133.8,75.7 135.2,77.8 136.7,79.8 138.2,81.7 139.7,83.6 141.1,85.5 142.6,87.3 144.1,89.1 145.6,90.8 147.0,92.5 148.5,94.1 150.0,95.8 151.5,97.3 153.0,98.8 154.4,100.3 155.9,101.8 157.4,103.2 158.9,104.6 160.3,105.9 161.8,107.2 163.3,108.5 164.8,109.8 166.2,111.0 167.7,112.2 169.2,113.3 170.7,114.5 172.2,115.6 173.6,116.6 175.1,117.7 176.6,118.7 178.1,119.7 179.5,120.7 181.0,121.6 182.5,122.6 184.0,123.5 185.5,124.3 185.5,159.1 184.0,156.8 182.5,154.4 181.0,152.0 179.5,149.7 178.1,147.3 176.6,144.9 175.1,142.6 173.6,140.2 172.2,137.9 170.7,135.5 169.2,133.1 167.7,130.8 166.2,128.4 164.8,126.0 163.3,123.7 161.8,121.3 160.3,118.9 158.9,116.6 157.4,114.2 155.9,111.9 154.4,109.5 153.0,107.1 151.5,104.8 150.0,102.4 148.5,100.0 147.0,97.7 145.6,95.3 144.1,92.9 142.6,90.6 141.1,88.2 139.7,85.9 138.2,83.5 136.7,81.1 135.2,78.8 133.8,76.4 132.3,74.0 130.8,71.7 129.3,69.3 127.8,66.9 126.4,64.6' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='96.8,3.2 99.9,11.1 102.9,18.5 106.0,25.6 109.0,32.4 112.1,38.7 115.1,44.8 118.2,50.6 121.2,56.0 124.3,61.2 127.3,66.1 130.4,70.8 133.5,75.3 136.5,79.5 139.6,83.5 142.6,87.3 145.7,90.9 148.7,94.4 151.8,97.6 154.8,100.7 157.9,103.7 160.9,106.5 164.0,109.1 167.0,111.6 170.1,114.0 173.1,116.3 176.2,118.4 179.2,120.5 182.3,122.4 185.4,124.3 188.4,126.0 191.5,127.7 194.5,129.3 197.6,130.8 200.6,132.2 203.7,133.6 206.7,134.9 209.8,136.1 212.8,137.2 215.9,138.3 218.9,139.4 222.0,140.4 225.0,141.3 228.1,142.2 231.2,143.1 234.2,143.9 237.3,144.7 240.3,145.4 243.4,146.1 246.4,146.7 249.5,147.4 252.5,148.0 255.6,148.5 258.6,149.0 261.7,149.6 264.7,150.0 267.8,150.5 270.8,150.9 273.9,151.3 276.9,151.7 280.0,152.1' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='100.4,23.0 148.8,100.5 197.3,178.0' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='126.4' cy='64.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='74.4' y='60.6'>(−½, e)</text><text x='31.8' y='28.7' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y=−2ex</text><text x='226.8' y='127.8' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>e^(−2x)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 159.1H294.0M185.5 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='67.3' y1='156.1' x2='67.3' y2='162.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='64.3' y='173.1' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='126.4' y1='156.1' x2='126.4' y2='162.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='123.4' y='173.1' font-size='10'>-0.5</text><line x1='182.5' y1='124.3' x2='188.5' y2='124.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='169.5' y='128.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='182.5' y1='89.6' x2='188.5' y2='89.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='169.5' y='93.6' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='182.5' y1='54.8' x2='188.5' y2='54.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='169.5' y='58.8' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_{-1/2}^0\\left(e^{-2x}+2ex\\right)dx=\\Bigl[-\\frac{e^{-2x}}2+ex^2\\Bigr]_{-1/2}^0=-\\frac12-\\left(-\\frac e2+\\frac e4\\right)=\\frac e4-\\frac12\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac e4-\\dfrac12\\approx0{,}180\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
